sentences.text:
This Writ petition has been filed on behalf of the Petitioner seeking the following reliefs:
"(a) Issue appropriate writ, order or direction to expedite the process of investigation in FIR No. 0409/2021 registered at PS. Amar Colony u/s 498A/406/34 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860;
(b) Direct filing of the Chargesheet against the Accused-Husband without further delay;
(c) Direct the Respondents to issue a Look-out Circular against the Accused- Husband;
(d) Pass any other order/direction which this Hon'ble Court may deem fit in the interest of justice;"
CRL.M.A. 1490/2024 (for withdrawl of captioned petition by Petitioner)
2.

